        <mxCell id="card-data-plane" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0891b2&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · data plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• Nominal path of a user who already has a session.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; Browser sends GET https://&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;project&amp;gt;.3istor.com. Cloudflare terminates TLS.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; The edge relays the request back through the app tunnel, which cloudflared opened outbound at startup. No inbound port on-prem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; cloudflared forwards it to Envoy over plain HTTP. Envoy matches the HTTPRoute and checks the OIDC session cookie.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; Envoy proxies to the Service.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; Cilium DNATs the Service VIP to an app pod.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt; The app queries its CloudNativePG cluster.&lt;br&gt;• Pink connections carry the OIDC login. Their order is in the OIDC sequence diagram.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="610" y="1340" width="620" height="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-control-plane" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7c3aed&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Background · control plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; VSO logs in with a namespace-bound role and reads kvv2.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; VSO writes the K8s Secret through the API server.&lt;br&gt;• Both cloudflared connectors open their tunnels outbound at startup.&lt;br&gt;• Dotted lines are object references (parentRef, targetRef, envFrom, clientSecret), not traffic.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1260" y="1340" width="460" height="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-gaps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Gaps between docs and code&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Network isolation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Docs describe a default-deny CCNP per project. None in code: Cilium runs without tenant policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G2&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Authorization.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; No groups-claim check: any account in realm 3istor opens any SSO app.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G3&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Transport.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; TLS ends at Cloudflare. In-cluster hops are plain HTTP, Vault included (tls_disable).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G4&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Coupling.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Tunnels target Envoy&amp;#39;s hashed Service (ac1e5388). Blocks AWS/GCP. Covered by D-05.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G5&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Tunnels.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; One per app, cloudflared on :latest. D-06 moves to one per project.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G6&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Token call.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; The template expects a cluster-local path to auth.3istor.com. None found in code: likely hairpins via Cloudflare. To verify.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1750" y="1340" width="550" height="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
